ine\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> shape</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shapes) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shape.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"垃圾回收-garbage-collection\">垃圾回收（Garbage Collection）</h2><p>V8 使用<strong>分代垃圾回收（Generational GC）</strong> 策略，将堆内存分为新生代和老生代。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Young[&quot;新生代 (Young Generation)&quot;]&#10;        Nursery[&quot;Nursery\\n新分配的对象&quot;]&#10;        Intermediate[&quot;Intermediate\\n存活过一次 GC&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Old[&quot;老生代 (Old Generation)&quot;]&#10;        OldSpace[&quot;Old Space\\n长期存活对象&quot;]&#10;        LargeObject[&quot;Large Object Space\\n大对象&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Nursery --&gt;|Scavenge 存活| Intermediate&#10;    Intermediate --&gt;|再次存活| OldSpace&#10;    Nursery --&gt;|大于阈值| LargeObject\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Young[\"新生代 (Young Generation)\"]\n        Nursery[\"Nursery\\n新分配的对象\"]\n        Intermediate[\"Intermediate\\n存活过一次 GC\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Old[\"老生代 (Old Generation)\"]\n        OldSpace[\"Old Space\\n长期存活对象\"]\n        LargeObject[\"Large Object Space\\n大对象\"]\n    end\n    Nursery --&gt;|Scavenge 存活| Intermediate\n    Intermediate --&gt;|再次存活| OldSpace\n    Nursery --&gt;|大于阈值| LargeObject</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>作用区域</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Scavenge (Minor GC)</td>\n<td>新生代</td>\n<td>频繁、快速、使用复制算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mark-Sweep</td>\n<td>老生代</td>\n<td>标记可达对象、清除不可达对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mark-Compact</td>\n<td>老生代</td>\n<td>标记后压缩内存、消除碎片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Incremental Marking</td>\n<td>老生代</td>\n<td>将标记工作分散到多个时间片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Concurrent Marking</td>\n<td>老生代</td>\n<td>在后台线程并发标记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const cache = new WeakMap&lt;object, string&gt;();&#10;&#10;function process(obj: object): string {&#10;  if (cache.has(obj)) {&#10;    return cache.get(obj)!;&#10;  }&#10;  const result = JSON.stringify(obj);&#10;  cache.set(obj, result);&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WeakMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">obj</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj, result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>WeakMap</code> 和 <code>WeakRef</code> 可以避免意外阻止垃圾回收。在 Chrome DevTools 的 Memory 面板中可以录制堆快照（Heap Snapshot）来排查内存泄漏。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>V8 采用 <strong>Ignition 解释器 + TurboFan 优化编译器</strong> 的双层架构</li>\n<li>源码经过 <strong>解析 → AST → 字节码 → JIT 优化机器码</strong> 的编译流水线</li>\n<li><strong>隐藏类</strong>使对象属性访问接近 C++ 结构体的速度，保持属性初始化顺序一致至关重要</li>\n<li><strong>内联缓存</strong>加速属性查找，保持单态（Monomorphic）状态可获得最佳性能</li>\n<li><strong>分代垃圾回收</strong>高效管理内存，使用 <code>WeakMap</code>/<code>WeakRef</code> 避免内存泄漏</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"V8 引擎","id":"v8-引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"V8 是什么","id":"v8-是什么"},{"level":2,"text":"解析阶段：从源码到 AST","id":"解析阶段-从源码到-ast"},{"level":2,"text":"Ignition 解释器","id":"ignition-解释器"},{"level":2,"text":"TurboFan 优化编译器","id":"turbofan-优化编译器"},{"level":2,"text":"隐藏类（Hidden Classes）","id":"隐藏类-hidden-classes"},{"level":2,"text":"内联缓存（Inline Caching）","id":"内联缓存-inline-caching"},{"level":2,"text":"垃圾回收（Garbage Collection）","id":"垃圾回收-garbage-collection"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"渲染流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/rendering-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"事件循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/event-loop"}}